WEBVTT

00:08:26.788 --> 00:08:30.788
the big challenge of midlife is
the armor that we're carrying,

00:08:30.788 --> 00:08:32.412
their armor that we're, you know,

00:08:32.454 --> 00:08:34.079
that's got us locked in and

00:08:34.079 --> 00:08:37.329
the weapons that were carrying that
kept us safe at some point.

00:08:38.121 --> 00:08:41.371
What is OK to let go of because
it's no longer serving

00:08:41.371 --> 00:08:44.329
and then how do we peel it off,
which is the scary part.

00:08:45.037 --> 00:08:50.746
You know, I do think that as I peeled mine
off and that was work I did with

00:08:50.746 --> 00:08:54.787
a therapist, and now I'm constantly trying
new things that I don't know

00:08:54.787 --> 00:08:56.287
whether I'm going to be good at or not.

00:08:56.579 --> 00:09:01.204
And I am failing, you know,
on occasion, you know,